//
// This can be used whenever the user is not interested in "precise" control of the naming of the
// individual channels.
//
// Usage Example:
// `AXI_TYPEDEF_ALL_CT(axi, axi_req_t, axi_rsp_t, addr_t, id_t, data_t, strb_t, user_t)
